<Grid><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><Path Width="18" Height="14" Stretch="Uniform" Data="M 2,30 L 6,8 L 16,20 L 24,2 L 32,20 L 42,8 L 46,30 Z" Fill="{StaticResource Gold}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
<TextBlock Text="{Binding VersionText}" Foreground="{StaticResource OnNavy}" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="NoWrap"/></StackPanel>
<StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
<TextBlock Text="{Binding RunStateText, StringFormat=● 引擎{0}}" Foreground="#9FE3B8" FontSize="12" Margin="0,0,22,0"/>
<TextBlock Text="数据库：SQLite" Foreground="{StaticResource OnNavy}" FontSize="12" Margin="0,0,22,0"/>
<TextBlock Text="{Binding ConfigSyncText, StringFormat=配置：{0}}" Foreground="{StaticResource OnNavy}" FontSize="12"/></StackPanel></Grid></Border>
